{"page":548,"verses":[{"verse_key":"59:17","surah":59,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"فَكَانَ عَـٰقِبَتَهُمَآ أَنَّهُمَا فِى ٱلنَّارِ خَـٰلِدَيْنِ فِيهَا ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ جَزَٰٓؤُا۟ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"both will end up in the Fire, there to remain. That is the reward of evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَكَانَ","en_gloss":"So will be","transliteration":"fakāna","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَتَهُمَآ","en_gloss":"(the) end of both of them","transliteration":"ʿāqibatahumā","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّهُمَا","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"annahumā","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(will be) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَـٰلِدَيْنِ","en_gloss":"abiding forever","transliteration":"khālidayni","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wadhālika","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَزَٰٓؤُا۟","en_gloss":"(is the) recompense","transliteration":"jazāu","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"59:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"59:17"}]},{"verse_key":"59:18","surah":59,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَلْتَنظُرْ نَفْسٌ مَّا قَدَّمَتْ لِغَدٍ ۖ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ خَبِيرٌۢ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe! Be mindful of God, and let every soul consider carefully what it sends ahead for tomorrow; be mindful of God, for God is well aware of everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"you (who)","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلْتَنظُرْ","en_gloss":"and let look","transliteration":"waltanẓur","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَفْسٌۭ","en_gloss":"every soul","transliteration":"nafsun","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَدَّمَتْ","en_gloss":"it has sent forth","transliteration":"qaddamat","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِغَدٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"for tomorrow","transliteration":"lighadin","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fear","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":15,"ar":"خَبِيرٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīrun","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"59:18"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"59:18"}]},{"verse_key":"59:19","surah":59,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَكُونُوا۟ كَٱلَّذِينَ نَسُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ فَأَنسَىٰهُمْ أَنفُسَهُمْ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not be like those who forget God, so God causes them to forget their own souls: they are the rebellious ones-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"takūnū","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"like those who","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَسُوا۟","en_gloss":"forgot","transliteration":"nasū","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَنسَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"so He made them forget","transliteration":"fa-ansāhum","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنفُسَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusahum","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"l-fāsiqūna","verse_key":"59:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"59:19"}]},{"verse_key":"59:20","surah":59,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يَسْتَوِىٓ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلنَّارِ وَأَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ هُمُ ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"there is no comparison between the inhabitants of the Fire and the inhabitants of Paradise- and the inhabitants of Paradise are the successful ones.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْتَوِىٓ","en_gloss":"equal","transliteration":"yastawī","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(are the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"and (the) companions","transliteration":"wa-aṣḥābu","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(The) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","en_gloss":"(of) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the achievers","transliteration":"l-fāizūna","verse_key":"59:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"59:20"}]},{"verse_key":"59:21","surah":59,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"لَوْ أَنزَلْنَا هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانَ عَلَىٰ جَبَلٍ لَّرَأَيْتَهُۥ خَـٰشِعًا مُّتَصَدِّعًا مِّنْ خَشْيَةِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَتِلْكَ ٱلْأَمْثَـٰلُ نَضْرِبُهَا لِلنَّاسِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If We had sent this Quran down to a mountain, you [Prophet] would have seen it humbled and split apart in its awe of God: We offer people such illustrations so that they may reflect.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We (had) sent down","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","en_gloss":"Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āna","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَبَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a mountain","transliteration":"jabalin","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّرَأَيْتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"surely you (would) have seen it","transliteration":"lara-aytahu","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَـٰشِعًۭا","en_gloss":"humbled","transliteration":"khāshiʿan","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّتَصَدِّعًۭا","en_gloss":"breaking asunder","transliteration":"mutaṣaddiʿan","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَشْيَةِ","en_gloss":"(the) fear","transliteration":"khashyati","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَتِلْكَ","en_gloss":"And these","transliteration":"watil'ka","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْثَـٰلُ","en_gloss":"examples","transliteration":"l-amthālu","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نَضْرِبُهَا","en_gloss":"We present them","transliteration":"naḍribuhā","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"to the people","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"give thought","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","verse_key":"59:21"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"59:21"}]},{"verse_key":"59:22","surah":59,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ عَـٰلِمُ ٱلْغَيْبِ وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ ۖ هُوَ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He is God: there is no god other than Him. It is He who knows what is hidden as well as what is in the open, He is the Lord of Mercy, the Giver of Mercy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ ۖ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَـٰلِمُ","en_gloss":"(the) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿālimu","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the unseen","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the witnessed","transliteration":"wal-shahādati","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"59:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"59:22"}]},{"verse_key":"59:23","surah":59,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ٱلْمَلِكُ ٱلْقُدُّوسُ ٱلسَّلَـٰمُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُ ٱلْمُهَيْمِنُ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْجَبَّارُ ٱلْمُتَكَبِّرُ ۚ سُبْحَـٰنَ ٱللَّهِ عَمَّا يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He is God: there is no god other than Him, the Controller, the Holy One, Source of Peace, Granter of Security, Guardian over all, the Almighty, the Compeller, the Truly Great; God is far above anything they consider to be His partner.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَلِكُ","en_gloss":"the Sovereign","transliteration":"l-maliku","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْقُدُّوسُ","en_gloss":"the Holy One","transliteration":"l-qudūsu","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلسَّلَـٰمُ","en_gloss":"the Giver of Peace","transliteration":"l-salāmu","verse_key":"59:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِ